    {
      "id": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/829722963459932160",
      "url": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/829722963459932160",
      "title": "My latest cartoon for New Scientist ",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/ac11a448e4ba10b1610287c135bb2e62/5cdfab80d510767d-b4/s640x960/79edca6edd1cd780de41b48da6dc209d0f30ccca.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"1000\" data-orig-width=\"1500\" alt=\"As we join the great theoretical scientist, he is deep in thought. So still, quiet and focused that he might almost be asleep. But inside that brilliant mind, what new idea is forming? What certainty is being meticulously interrogated? What ingenious theory is ready to change our world forever? (the scientist snores lightly) Ah, it seems he actually is asleep. And that's fine. Science is hard and not every day can be a success. We will come back another time.  \" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/ac11a448e4ba10b1610287c135bb2e62/5cdfab80d510767d-b4/s75x75_c1/7dae388ca910b52750a248f68989d446dc7b8369.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ac11a448e4ba10b1610287c135bb2e62/5cdfab80d510767d-b4/s100x200/cfe3d2bb6a8b2f31a3a098fdb4b18cbe65882bc2.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ac11a448e4ba10b1610287c135bb2e62/5cdfab80d510767d-b4/s250x400/d6903d9db1d5036b7ddfcf0a07587957c8a6cbaf.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ac11a448e4ba10b1610287c135bb2e62/5cdfab80d510767d-b4/s400x600/7cff1e7c7fe3b3608b604692798bc529f5b33ced.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ac11a448e4ba10b1610287c135bb2e62/5cdfab80d510767d-b4/s500x750/c6a90f12f42ba5e2d3488c0d1002403477422903.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ac11a448e4ba10b1610287c135bb2e62/5cdfab80d510767d-b4/s540x810/8ccae1603008f0ef4c8100cb02148a8befe38f3d.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ac11a448e4ba10b1610287c135bb2e62/5cdfab80d510767d-b4/s640x960/79edca6edd1cd780de41b48da6dc209d0f30ccca.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ac11a448e4ba10b1610287c135bb2e62/5cdfab80d510767d-b4/s1280x1920/f058c62e77240ae5d61899cc40203dbca44a0b04.jpg 1280w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/ac11a448e4ba10b1610287c135bb2e62/5cdfab80d510767d-b4/s2048x3072/b69ed4b3466da9225c4ade41a5e940d8f39451a6.jpg 1500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: