    {
      "id": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/829539108903911424",
      "url": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/829539108903911424",
      "title": "My latest @guardian books cartoon ",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/cc87ef4a267c0ca4271240cd7fb23111/b43524a5d32bbf95-24/s640x960/d95dd5a4144072d3f0827d918bd6393e4eed3fa7.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"821\" data-orig-width=\"1500\" alt=\"Title: Just announced! Three new Gruffalo books commissioned from bestselling authors!  Lee Chilld: The Gruffalo just wants a quiet life, but when a crime syndicate moves into the deep dark wood, he must use his terrible claws and the terrible teeth in his terrible jaws to protect the fellow.  Sally Rooney: The Gruffalo moves to contemporary Dublin. He   ill ever see past his orange eyes, purple prickles and poisonous wart.  Kazuo Ishiguro: After a long absence, the gruffalo returns to the forest and attempts to make sense of his past. Encounters with a mouse, a fox, an owl and a snake uncover long-buried memories, regrets and revelations.\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/cc87ef4a267c0ca4271240cd7fb23111/b43524a5d32bbf95-24/s75x75_c1/a98af9d4161ce45b376fc95454324defa46d9d1e.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cc87ef4a267c0ca4271240cd7fb23111/b43524a5d32bbf95-24/s100x200/074208da863e157679b745b35982236a52c2dd47.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cc87ef4a267c0ca4271240cd7fb23111/b43524a5d32bbf95-24/s250x400/73dc3f07dac787068e5ef88aba109c173cf50484.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cc87ef4a267c0ca4271240cd7fb23111/b43524a5d32bbf95-24/s400x600/28a2207eec5e636195e0b9dd0a8b9f6cfaf913be.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cc87ef4a267c0ca4271240cd7fb23111/b43524a5d32bbf95-24/s500x750/d4afd0af64cb9c31bcce63291d4e2429408768d1.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cc87ef4a267c0ca4271240cd7fb23111/b43524a5d32bbf95-24/s540x810/82b8e3594ede98a863ec09a07266582ba6d1e607.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cc87ef4a267c0ca4271240cd7fb23111/b43524a5d32bbf95-24/s640x960/d95dd5a4144072d3f0827d918bd6393e4eed3fa7.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cc87ef4a267c0ca4271240cd7fb23111/b43524a5d32bbf95-24/s1280x1920/38d9a93f8984a9d9182ad0d617ca2d0d213