      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/cf9d5c96d836399f1777a3947ee9103b/16f581488f58115b-12/s640x960/5d87d88c5e6fc658e4b22b8db7465f6924e53aab.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"830\" data-orig-width=\"1500\" alt=\"Title: Author Simulator   Level 1: Get to desk and begin! (Platform video game-style image of an author jumping from a block onto  a cloud with desk and computer) Result: success!  Level 2: Press on despite distractions! (Author typing as the desk/clod moves past a ghost and a spider) ) Result: success!  Level 3: Deliver manuscript to editor! (Author jumping over fire pit onto platform where editor waits) Result: success!  Level 4: Accept minor criticism! (Author lying ded in fronto of editors desk) Result: better luck next time!  Along the bottom are controls for:  Left right jump crouch read write nap coffee \" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/cf9d5c96d836399f1777a3947ee9103b/16f581488f58115b-12/s75x75_c1/722f4444cce2983eb607d737b386e6e41f4f74da.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cf9d5c96d836399f1777a3947ee9103b/16f581488f58115b-12/s100x200/57903ba72e692c7520ac1fee82c85b1256b43e3d.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cf9d5c96d836399f1777a3947ee9103b/16f581488f58115b-12/s250x400/e2fe6e35bd8418ce49d37b4fa647ace92591efda.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cf9d5c96d836399f1777a3947ee9103b/16f581488f58115b-12/s400x600/d9fde05f221c3ea744dedc61f46cd927f851bbd3.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cf9d5c96d836399f1777a3947ee9103b/16f581488f58115b-12/s500x750/c4761ed081413dd9458f120750aeb8ac845f05eb.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cf9d5c96d836399f1777a3947ee9103b/16f581488f58115b-12/s540x810/33581331beb4702dd474ca48afbd2671afd4cde2.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cf9d5c96d836399f1777a3947ee9103b/16f581488f58115b-12/s640x960/5d87d88c5e6fc658e4b22b8db7465f6924e53aab.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/cf9d5c96d836399f1777a3947ee9103b/16f581488f58115b-12/s1280x1920/d13137ae7ba61f635eb15582329477a459d865e3.jpg 1280w, https://64.m